    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-sample/q2",
      "question": "<p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span> passes through the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> and is perpendicular to the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf n\"></span></p><p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OA} = \\begin{pmatrix} 5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -4 \\end{pmatrix} \\quad \\text{and} \\quad \\mathbf n = \\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> is the origin,</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) find a Cartesian equation of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>With respect to the fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>, the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> is given by the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf{r} = \\begin{pmatrix} 7 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2 \\end{pmatrix} + \\lambda \\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 3 \\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>The line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> intersects the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span> at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"X\"></span>.</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Show that the acute angle between the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span> and the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"21.2^\\circ\"></span> correct to one decimal place.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(c) Find the coordinates of the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"X\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p>",
