      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-sample/q8",
      "question": "<p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Shade on an Argand diagram the set of points</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left\\{ z \\in \\mathbb{C} : |z - 4i| \\leq 3 \\right\\} \\cap \\left\\{ z \\in \\mathbb{C} : -\\frac{\\pi}{2} &lt; \\arg(z + 3 - 4i) \\leq \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right\\}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></p><p>The complex number <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w\"></span> satisfies</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"|w - 4i| = 3\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find the maximum value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\arg w\"></span> in the interval <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\pi, \\pi]\"></span>.</p><p>Give your answer in radians correct to 2 decimal places.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
